[Em]Ear-[D]ly in the [Em]morning

{comment: Refrain}
[Em]Hooray, and up she rises
[D]Hooray, and up she rises
[Em]Hooray, and up she rises
[Em]Ear-[D]ly in the [Em]morning

{comment: Strophe 6}
[Em]Tie him to the scuppers with the hose pipe on him
